rusty-bucket
============

A read-only FUSE filesystem for S3-compatible object stores (such as Ceph RGW),
written in Rust. It is a read-only port of goofys.

This product includes software derived from goofys:

  goofys - a high-performance, POSIX-ish Amazon S3 file system written in Go
  Copyright (C) 2015 - 2019 Ka-Hing Cheung
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  https://github.com/kahing/goofys

It also incorporates the readdir inode-leak fix (goofys PR #786) as carried by
the StatCan fork:

  https://github.com/StatCan/goofys

The FUSE binding is provided by the `fuser` crate (MIT licensed) and the S3
client by the official AWS SDK for Rust (Apache-2.0/MIT).
